          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:63f91d218eef16f9a18dab9414b21d4171b57ff93b83d323c54d796811427724:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_06777c8d4da04c94a7a2e65d14b92fb2",
      "statement": "`parseInvitationGrant` is strict and all-or-nothing under namespaced keys — a role outside `public.profile_role`, a blank tenant id, or a half-formed pair yields `null`, whose fallback is `viewer` with no membership.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://modules/auth/domain/invitationMetadata.ts#L58-L78",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:cbd0f237742fef41f0c08d99437a359c5dd75f632673363072e7c3e3aab6b954:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://tests/unit/user-access.test.ts#L142-L190",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:31758c217be1cd477ec144770e2a32e99cc87d29463150f3bd21bff8bc403800:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_dfacd1921063414f9ae4004707bbb43c",
      "statement": "Provisioning applies a grant only on insert or as repair of a profile with no memberships: the existing-profile path updates `full_name`/`email` only, leaving `role` and `is_active` admin-managed, so a later Clerk edit or webhook re-delivery can never silently re-grant.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://modules/auth/data/provisioning.ts#L58-L106",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:5819344d5a62d8f7f4d124f63a55d72841e2801657f2070eb7a2e029dc70feba:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_d6f8d6a8c6964eeb93216b6c037e3d6c",
      "statement": "A membership is written only when the profile holds none, so a grant can never add a second school or move a person an admin already seated, while an admin-authored grant on a tenantless user via the Backend API still lands.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://modules/auth/data/provisioning.ts#L81-L86",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:04dda7695ece6336018ead210b20db8777338e7bb8bfcfb0ab1f08a7dead34b7:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://supabase/migrations/20260906120000_ensure_invitation_membership_atomic.sql#L19-L25",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:81038ea6dcc4e7c86314a84c8c50103ba1f0115c15f1bfc0ec5b366bc27ce3b2:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_ba86573e3d354149a522a56cbf2c78a2",
      "statement": "`ensure_profile_tenant_membership` locks the profile row, checks and inserts in one transaction, which prevents concurrent deliveries from both observing an empty membership set and assigning different default schools; the lock is also what makes `is_default: true` correct by construction.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://modules/auth/data/provisioning.ts#L108-L130",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:17811d832d524923ee1f6a5d60eec4b1347d3c6ffde297c5bca4129208e21040:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://supabase/migrations/20260906120000_ensure_invitation_membership_atomic.sql#L4-L29",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:9011891e88d23aec441fab964ce99b6222bf91bad1ecbd688aa8082952877c4b:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_c48376e4b0594d0996588b5bb2d7810d",
      "statement": "On a membership failure the helper logs and rethrows so the route answers 500 and Clerk retries; a duplicate-key error (23505) is accepted instead because a writer outside the helper may have inserted the same membership without the lock.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://modules/auth/data/provisioning.ts#L131-L146",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:6afcc5aec90f5fa3f3555d2a9d6d93ef9219405e874bd4377c683d6af31badc7:"
        },
        {
