          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:40a7e0d99535fa8351d549d7dba29a7d24b13d1410dfd9ea4f94edbfdbca2cdb:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_add298a6029f4849897ee04f93d3beb0",
      "statement": "The membership RPC is `security invoker` but granted to `service_role` only, so RLS inside it never evaluates for the session-less webhook; this is the deliberate mirror of `create_school`, which is also `security invoker` but granted to `authenticated` so RLS does fire.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://docs/adr/ADR-006-platform-admin-and-school-registry.md#L144-L154",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:93ded452586cc3a17df5711f5f7b8892e3e60011813755165fec9855233114c3:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://supabase/migrations/20260906120000_ensure_invitation_membership_atomic.sql#L32-L35",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:42c27e9882183e6d4a649a3a1aef44d5bc3b7ec12c39efb9e0d61c7289358613:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_4fb65dbf538b4dca9029701a5ee9d962",
      "statement": "The admin seating path issues a role UPDATE and then a membership INSERT with no shared transaction, restores the prior role when the INSERT fails, and treats an UPDATE matching zero rows as `denied` because PostgREST reports a blocked UPDATE as an empty result rather than an error.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://modules/tenancy/data/users.ts#L240-L323",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:8f656eeb9184a425d325cac5f77da4a8baf062671b344d13132971752ea81bcb:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://modules/tenancy/data/users.ts#L325-L352",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:246f50ed59d281f11b33b584409017e4f84c2f4556be3ef3cc82d1f152045270:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_b7f30a1f4d354a458d87c64f06278494",
      "statement": "The admin path writes `is_default: false` because its client is RLS-scoped, so an empty membership list means 'none this admin can see' and trusting it would create a second default row; `mapProfileRow` falls back to `memberships[0]` when nothing is flagged.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://modules/tenancy/data/tenancy.ts#L80-L96",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:b345bd00d7b3fbafbdd1010857e06e4cf7af2ac77d2fb89661f9a570078bb591:"
        },
        {
